            "english": "Run this server first in a separate terminal. The server will stop on the accept() line until a client comes. The client code is: new Socket(\"localhost\", 5000), then write \"Hello Server\" with a PrintWriter and read the answer with a BufferedReader. The output of this code depends on the message of the client, so no output is given here.",
