          "language": "java",
          "code": "import java.io.BufferedReader;\nimport java.io.InputStreamReader;\nimport java.io.PrintWriter;\nimport java.net.Socket;\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class ChatClient {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        Socket socket = new Socket(\"localhost\", 5000);\n        BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(socket.getInputStream()));\n        PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(socket.getOutputStream(), true);\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        System.out.print(\"Apna naam likho: \");\n        out.println(scanner.nextLine());\n        Thread reader = new Thread(() -> {\n            try {\n                String line;\n                while ((line = in.readLine()) != null) {\n                    System.out.println(line);\n                }\n            } catch (Exception e) {\n                System.out.println(\"Server band ho gaya.\");\n            }\n        });\n        reader.start();\n        String message;\n        while (!(message = scanner.nextLine()).equals(\"bye\")) {\n            out.println(message);\n        }\n        socket.close();\n    }\n}",
          "note": {
            "hinglish": "Reader thread server se aane wale message chhapta hai, jabki main thread keyboard se message bhejta hai. Dono ek saath chalte hain — ek thread se dono kaam nahi ho sakte. Is code ka output server aur dusre client par depend karta hai, isliye yahan output nahi diya gaya.",
            "english": "The reader thread prints the messages coming from the server, while the main thread sends messages from the keyboard. Both run together — one thread cannot do both jobs. The output of this code depends on the server and the other clients, so no output is given here.",
            "hindi": "Reader thread server से आने वाले message छापता है, जबकि main thread keyboard से message भेजता है। दोनों एक साथ चलते हैं — एक thread से दोनों काम नहीं हो सकते। इस code का output server और दूसरे client पर depend करता है, इसलिए यहाँ output नहीं दिया गया।"
          }
