        "task": {
          "hinglish": "Starter code mein paise bhejne ka poora transaction pattern hai. Apne MySQL mein account table banao (name, balance) aur Sid aur Meera ke account mein 1000-1000 daalo. Phir program chalao aur balance check karo. Done tab mana jayega jab Sid ka balance 500 aur Meera ka 1500 ho. Phir Meera ka naam galat karke chalao — dono balance wapas pehle jaise hone chahiye, kyunki rollback hoga.",
          "english": "The starter code has the full transaction pattern for sending money. In your MySQL, make an account table (name, balance) and put 1000-1000 in the accounts of Sid and Meera. Then run the program and check the balance. You are done when the balance of Sid is 500 and that of Meera is 1500. Then run it again with the wrong name for Meera — both balances must go back to what they were before, because a rollback will happen.",
          "hindi": "Starter कोड में पैसे भेजने का पूरा transaction pattern है। अपने MySQL में account table बनाएँ (name, balance) और Sid और Meera के account में 1000-1000 डालें। फिर प्रोग्राम चलाएँ और balance check करें। आप तब सफल हैं जब Sid का balance 500 और Meera का 1500 हो। फिर Meera का नाम गलत करके चलाएँ — दोनों balance वापस पहले जैसे होने चाहिए, क्योंकि rollback होगा।"
        },
        "language": "java",
        "starter": "import java.sql.Connection;\nimport java.sql.DriverManager;\nimport java.sql.PreparedStatement;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        String url = \"jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/shop\";\n        Connection con = DriverManager.getConnection(url, \"root\", \"password\");\n        con.setAutoCommit(false);\n        try {\n            PreparedStatement out = con.prepareStatement(\n                \"UPDATE account SET balance = balance - ? WHERE name = ?\");\n            out.setInt(1, 500);\n            out.setString(2, \"Sid\");\n            int rowsOut = out.executeUpdate();\n            PreparedStatement in = con.prepareStatement(\n                \"UPDATE account SET balance = balance + ? WHERE name = ?\");\n            in.setInt(1, 500);\n            in.setString(2, \"Meera\");\n            int rowsIn = in.executeUpdate();\n            if (rowsOut == 0 || rowsIn == 0) {\n                throw new RuntimeException(\"Account nahi mila\");\n            }\n            con.commit();\n            System.out.println(\"Transfer poora hua\");\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            con.rollback();\n            System.out.println(\"Transfer fail - sab wapas: \" + e.getMessage());\n        } finally {\n            con.setAutoCommit(true);\n            con.close();\n        }\n    }\n}"
